  "about": "PressCount (types/0x0010-key-input.md): a lifetime counter, RO and persistent, stored every 64 presses rather than at each one; loaded at start. A factory reset does not touch it — it counts wear, not configuration (zadania/zrobione/TASK-01.md N6, N7).",
  "profile": "key",
